WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.369 --> 00:00:02.952
(upbeat music)

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.570
- Polygon Studio is a design tool

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:19.470
that allows users to create
these polarized light mosaics

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:21.660
using custom mosaic designs.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.640
Users can create their mosaic design

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:26.520
using a vector drawing
tool of their choice.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:29.640
Once they have that they
can import their design

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:33.300
into Polygon Studio and Polygon Studio

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:37.020
recolors the design to use
the closest matching colors

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:39.330
in the database, which was computed

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:42.060
from the user supply of cellophane

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.730
and once they have one design in,

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.790
they can import another mosaic design.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:50.430
And when they import
multiple mosaic designs

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:54.780
it allows them to create these
color changing behaviors,

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:58.170
which they can also
preview using the tool.

00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:00.630
So there is an interactive mode

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:04.200
that lets users preview the
color changing behaviors

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:08.640
and understand exactly
how these mosaics work

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:12.180
by rotating the constituent
components of the mosaic.

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:15.270
So once they're happy with
all the colors in their design

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:17.610
and all the color changing effects,

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.953
they can export their
design for fabrication

00:01:19.953 --> 00:01:23.100
and cut it up with a laser cutter.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.683
(upbeat music)

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:05.040
I think a lot of people think about

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:09.720
how technological progress can inspire art

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:13.440
but not how art can inspire
technological process.

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.660
So just thinking about
it in an inverse way

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:16.893
I think is really cool.

